+// REQUIRES: rcgmp, linux
+// A Reussir shared library with `Nat` textures, which links its own copies
+// of the runtime and of the rcgmp runtime, loaded into a host that also links
+// the shared Reussir runtime ahead of it. The library's rcgmp glue
+// (`__reussir_rcgmp_ffi_acquire` and friends) is hidden, so its textures bind
+// their own copy, next to their own rcgmp runtime, whatever else the process
+// loads; the library exports none of it.
